</section>

<section class="section about" id="about">
  <div class="portrait"></div>
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">About the artist</div><h2>Meet Emily Harris</h2>
    <p>Emily Harris is a contemporary artist whose layered paintings explore memory, place and the emotional traces we leave behind.</p>
    <p>Influenced by modern abstraction, vintage photography and changing city light, Emily builds each piece slowly — allowing texture, color and chance to shape the final story.</p>
    <div class="facts"><div><strong>18+</strong><span>Exhibitions</span></div><div><strong>42</strong><span>Works created</span></div><div><strong>8</strong><span>Years creating</span></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section media" id="media">
  <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Inside the studio</div><h2>Media & Stories</h2></div><div class="muted">Interviews · Studio visits · Events</div></div>
